flowchart LR
  accTitle: From a question to a visual explanation
  accDescr: The agent decides whether a visual helps, then creates local HTML and optionally publishes an authorized document.
  A[User asks a question] --> B{Would a visual help?}
  B -->|Yes| C[Create themed HTML]
  B -->|No| D[Answer in chat]
  C --> E[Review diagram and content]
  E --> F[Deliver local HTML]
  F -->|Hosting authorized| G[Upload through Postplan]
